  "coverage": {
    "record_files_examined": 1016675,
    "method": "Independent inventory of all retained project/worktree, historical authoring, supplied-layer and installed-overlay roots identified from project records and session metadata. Font references and rendering APIs are searched in text formats without a size cutoff; authoring outputs, source scripts, recipes and conversations are then checked per material. File counts include originals, duplicate histories and tool records and are not localized-image counts.",
    "excluded_from_font_discovery": [
      "dependency and version-control internals; retained project, original-asset and historical-output directories are not excluded",
      "raw image pixels are inventoried but never used to guess a font identity"
    ],
    "release_scope": "All standalone WebP/AVIF files in five current AGE2 public manifests (859) and all PNG files in the PF/PM BETA 0.1.2 embedded manifests (2861). AGE2 EPK files in these packages are string resources, EGPACK files are text tables and GUT files are resource declarations; no additional image container was found in this checked set. Original base-game artwork not carried by the patches is not counted as newly typeset work. Historical and local-only materials are investigated separately.",
